PipelineHoldsFunction {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "A '.dsp' holds '#pragma pipeline', 'uniform', 'static const', 'buffer' and 'pass' declarations and an 'hlsl' block, and '{0}' is a function outside it; an HLSL function goes in an 'hlsl { }' block, the file's or a pass's, and a DreamShaderLang one in a '.dss' or a '.dsh'."
    text  "'.dsp' 中只有 '#pragma pipeline'、'uniform'、'static const'、'buffer'、'pass' 声明和一个 'hlsl' 块，而 '{0}' 是写在块外的函数；HLSL 函数请写进 'hlsl { }' 块（文件级的或某个 Pass 的），DreamShaderLang 函数请写在 '.dss' 或 '.dsh' 里。"
    state machine
}

