SharedCodeNamesBinding {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "'{0}' is in the shared code of the file's 'hlsl' block, and pass '{1}' defines it in its HLSL slot ('{2}'); the shared code is compiled into the slot of every pass whose HLSL is in the '.dsp', after those #defines. Rename it in the block: only an entry, compiled into the slots of the passes that name it, uses a pass's names."
    text  "'{0}' 出现在文件级 'hlsl' 块的共用代码中，而 Pass '{1}' 在其 HLSL 槽位中定义了它（'{2}'）；共用代码会编译进每个 HLSL 写在 '.dsp' 中的 Pass 的槽位，位于这些 #define 之后。请在块中重命名它：只有入口（只编译进指定它的 Pass 的槽位）才能使用 Pass 的名称。"
    state machine
}

CustomStencilNotBindable {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "'CustomStencil' is the stencil half of the custom depth texture, which no pass can bind as a texture of its own, and pass '{0}' {1} it; read it through the scene textures instead: a SceneTexture node in the material, CalcSceneCustomStencil in a '.usf'."
    text  "'CustomStencil' 是自定义深度纹理中的模板部分，任何 Pass 都无法把它当作独立的纹理来绑定，而 Pass '{0}' 要{1}它；请改为通过场景纹理读取它：在材质中用 SceneTexture 节点，在 '.usf' 中用 CalcSceneCustomStencil。"
    state machine
}

