}

TonemapperWritesNothing {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "Pass '{0}' replaces the tonemapper, which makes the frame's final colour, and writes no 'SceneColor'; add 'write SceneColor;'."
    text  "Pass '{0}' 替换了负责生成帧最终颜色的色调映射器，却没有写入 'SceneColor'；请添加 'write SceneColor;'。"
