ReadNeverWrittenNoClear {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "Pass '{0}' reads '{1}', which no pass writes, and '{1}' is 'Clear = None', so what it reads is undefined."
    text  "Pass '{0}' 读取 '{1}'，但没有任何 Pass 写入它，而 '{1}' 是 'Clear = None'，因此读到的内容是未定义的。"
    state machine
}

ReadBeforeWriteNoClear {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "Pass '{0}' reads '{1}' before '{2}' writes it, and '{1}' is 'Clear = None', so what it reads is undefined; move the reader after the writer, or give the buffer a 'Clear' value."
    text  "Pass '{0}' 在 '{2}' 写入 '{1}' 之前就读取了它，而 '{1}' 是 'Clear = None'，因此读到的内容是未定义的；请把读取方移到写入方之后，或给该缓冲一个 'Clear' 值。"
    state machine
}

ReadBeforeWrite {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "Pass '{0}' reads '{1}' before '{2}' writes it in the frame, so it reads the buffer's 'Clear' value; move the reader after the writer, or read '{1}.Previous'."
    text  "在帧内，Pass '{0}' 在 '{2}' 写入 '{1}' 之前就读取了它，因此读到的是该缓冲的 'Clear' 值；请把读取方移到写入方之后，或读取 '{1}.Previous'。"
    state machine
}

BufferNeverWritten {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "No pass writes buffer '{0}', so whoever reads it reads its 'Clear' value."
    text  "没有任何 Pass 写入缓冲 '{0}'，因此无论谁读取它，读到的都是它的 'Clear' 值。"
    state machine
}

BufferNeverRead {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "No pass reads buffer '{0}' and it is not exported, so writing it is wasted work; read it, export it, or remove it."
    text  "没有任何 Pass 读取缓冲 '{0}'，它也没有导出，因此写入它是白费工夫；请读取它、导出它，或删除它。"
    state machine
}

ExportLateFrame {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "Buffer '{0}' is exported and last written at {1}: opaque and translucent materials that sample it see the previous frame's contents, UI sees this frame's."
    text  "缓冲 '{0}' 已导出，最后一次写入在 {1}：采样它的不透明和半透明材质看到的是上一帧的内容，UI 看到的是本帧的。"
