ExportMidFrame {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/Semantic/LangBinderPipeline.cpp
    src   "Buffer '{0}' is exported and last written at {1}: opaque materials that sample it see the previous frame's contents, translucent and post-process materials and UI see this frame's."
    text  "缓冲 '{0}' 已导出，最后一次写入在 {1}：采样它的不透明材质看到的是上一帧的内容，半透明材质、后处理材质和 UI 看到的是本帧的。"
