    src   "'#pragma pipeline' configures a Custom Pass pipeline and belongs in a '.dsp' file of its own, and this line is in '{0}'; move it, with the pipeline's buffers and passes, into a '.dsp'."
    text  "'#pragma pipeline' 配置的是 Custom Pass 管线，应当放在它自己的 '.dsp' 文件里，而这一行在 '{0}' 中；请把它连同管线的缓冲和 Pass 一起移到 '.dsp' 中。"
