    src   "An 'hlsl' block at file scope is the HLSL of a Custom Pass pipeline, which only a '.dsp' file holds, and '{0}' is not one; a pipeline cannot be included."
    text  "文件级的 'hlsl' 块是 Custom Pass 管线的 HLSL，只有 '.dsp' 文件才能包含它，而 '{0}' 不是 '.dsp'；管线不能被 include。"
